{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43596","headline":"游长安诸寺联句 常乐坊赵景公寺 题约公院 · 段成式","name":"游长安诸寺联句 常乐坊赵景公寺 题约公院","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"印火荧荧，灯续焰青。\n七俱胝咒，四阿含经。\n各录佳语，聊事素屏。\n丈室安居，延宾不扃。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"段成式","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43596.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43596","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}